       and convert (decimal (16, 3), ins.InHGldFiness)= convert (decimal (16, 3), del.InHGldFiness)     
       and convert (decimal (16, 3), ins.InHPlFiness)= convert (decimal (16, 3), del.InHPlFiness)     
