  (Bef 2.13) ****/    
    
  /*** (Jen 2.13) ***/      
  /******** If @wTcTyp= 'CTB' then Cannot Change InCmCd, InRsMulDiv, InCnvRt if Record exists in InvDsg ********/     
  /* Current Partition */    
  If @wTcTyp= 'CTB'     
