        when 'CIF' then InFOB+ (case when InHHideCommYN ='Y' then 0 Else InComm End)+ InFrt+ InIns +(case when InHSelfDscYN ='Y' then 0 Else InDsc End) +(case when InHSelfDeductYN ='Y' then 0 Else InDeduct End)    
